WEBVTT

00:03.881 --> 00:05.251
<b>Humans!</b>

00:05.251 --> 00:08.001
<b>Take heed, lest you be annihilated!{If you wish not for annihilation, take heed!}</b>

00:08.001 --> 00:10.761
<b>I bear a message from the depths!</b>

00:16.801 --> 00:21.641
<b>You will surrender the surface to us, 
the Clan of the Seafolk!</b>

00:25.731 --> 00:30.821
<b>Thereafter, you shall become 
our nourishment, human scum—</b>

00:33.321 --> 00:37.991
<b>Nice head! Are you related to an octopus{ by any chance}?</b>

00:43.411 --> 00:46.541
<b>I heard it was that same guy again.</b>

00:46.541 --> 00:47.751
<b>What was his name?</b>

00:48.251 --> 00:51.301
<b>I forget, but he's super strong.{he does have super strength, but so does everybody and their uncle. he's *very* strong}{previous comment references removal of a hyphen}</b>

00:56.711 --> 00:59.711
65. Name: Rare marine life form passing by  ID:lispmp2487

00:56.711 --> 00:59.711
he takes out every oppenent with a single punch.

00:56.711 --> 00:59.711
66. Name: Rare marine life form passing by  ID:mfygnasg9

00:56.711 --> 00:59.711
didn't he turn out to be a fraud?

00:56.711 --> 00:59.711
