03:44.551 --> 03:45.511
<b>Master…</b>

03:45.511 --> 03:48.181
<b>You have moved up to rank 2 in Class C.</b>

03:48.971 --> 03:51.481
<b>You are on the verge of entering Class B!</b>

03:52.061 --> 03:53.771
<b>Class B, huh?</b>

03:53.771 --> 03:56.771
<b>That means I won't have any more 
weekly hero quotas, right?</b>

03:56.771 --> 03:57.521
<b>Correct.</b>

03:58.231 --> 03:59.941
<b>Oh, excuse me…</b>

03:59.941 --> 04:00.981
<b>Hello?</b>

04:00.981 --> 04:03.481
<b>City J? It is a bit far.</b>

04:03.481 --> 04:05.651
