04:05.651 --> 04:07.281
<b>Busy guy…</b>

04:08.951 --> 04:10.411
<b>Master!</b>

04:10.411 --> 04:13.241
<b>The monster you defeated on your way home the other day</b>

04:13.241 --> 04:15.661
<b>called itself one of the "Seafolk," right?</b>

04:15.661 --> 04:16.751
<b>I forget.</b>

04:17.911 --> 04:22.301
<b><i>Several monsters calling themselves the "Clan of the Seafolk"</i></b>

04:22.301 --> 04:24.851
<b><i>have appeared in City J and 
are attacking anyone in sight.</i></b>

04:23.101 --> 04:28.731
<b>An A-class hero is fighting them all alone 
and on the brink of defeat.</b>

04:24.851 --> 04:27.351
