04:44.741 --> 04:48.201
<b>You've got spunk, you slimy sons of bitches.</b>

04:49.041 --> 04:51.331
<b>My beloved Bamboo Shoot here</b>

04:51.331 --> 04:54.961
<b>is happy to be battling enemies with some grit for a change.</b>

04:55.671 --> 04:57.711
<b>But it's time to end this.</b>

04:58.301 --> 05:00.261
<b>You can quit your bluffing{boasting}, human!</b>

05:00.261 --> 05:03.761
<b>Your foolish fan club has run off.</b>

05:03.761 --> 05:06.101
<b>But you won't have that luxury.{r death will not be easy.}</b>

05:06.101 --> 05:09.481
<b>You will suffer long and hard 
for taking our brothers' lives.</b>

05:09.481 --> 05:11.351
<b>Four fish to go!</b>

05:11.851 --> 05:15.731
<b>It's a lot easier without an audience!</b>

05:16.691 --> 05:18.231
<b>Sing, Bamboo Shoot!</b>

05:22.031 --> 05:25.991
<b>Gigantic Drill Stinger Quadruple Thrust!</b>

05:28.291 --> 05:29.911
<b>I did it…</b>

05:29.911 --> 05:31.281
<b>I did it!</b>

05:31.711 --> 05:35.751
<b>These monsters were probably a God-level threat,</b>

05:35.961 --> 05:37.081
<b>and I beat them all by my—</b>

05:38.091 --> 05:41.421
<b>You know, when something's <i>this</i>{so} annoying,</b>

05:41.421 --> 05:42.931
<b>it's a pleasure to watch it die.</b>

05:48.351 --> 05:50.561
<b>How much farther is City J?</b>

05:50.561 --> 05:52.351
<b>We are almost there.</b>

05:52.351 --> 05:53.691
<b>But I am getting no readings.</b>

05:54.351 --> 05:55.441
<b>I will scout ahead.</b>

05:55.441 --> 05:57.981
<b>Once I have confirmed their location, 
I will let you know.</b>

05:59.031 --> 06:00.321
<b>H-Hey!</b>

06:02.571 --> 06:05.951
<b><i>This is an announcement from the Hero Association.</i></b>

06:05.951 --> 06:09.371
<b><i>The threat level is: Tiger.</i></b>

06:09.371 --> 06:13.201
<b><i>All citizens, please stay clear of the area.</i></b>

06:13.201 --> 06:15.831
<b>CITY A</b>

06:13.201 --> 06:15.831
<b>HERO ASSOCIATION HQ</b>

06:14.871 --> 06:15.831
<b>Was the warning issued?</b>

06:16.131 --> 06:18.171
<b>The request just went out.</b>

06:18.171 --> 06:21.381
<b>We'll need to update and re-issue it.</b>

06:22.091 --> 06:22.921
<b>What do you mean?</b>

06:22.921 --> 06:24.381
<b>Stinger is down.</b>

06:28.101 --> 06:31.311
<b>Mumen Rider here. I'm heading in.</b>

06:31.311 --> 06:32.731
<b>Give me the location.</b>

06:32.731 --> 06:34.891
<b><i>All lines are busy at this time—</i></b>

06:34.891 --> 06:35.901
<b>Where are they?</b>

06:35.901 --> 06:37.981
<b>Hey, best forget it!</b>

06:38.981 --> 06:41.481
<b>This one's above our pay grade.{Class C heroes can't handle this one.}</b>

06:41.481 --> 06:42.241
<b>Huh?</b>

06:42.241 --> 06:45.241
<b>The word just came down.</b>

06:45.241 --> 06:47.371
<b><i>Emergency evacuation warning.</i></b>

06:47.371 --> 06:51.161
<b><i>The threat level has been 
raised from Tiger to Demon.</i></b>

06:51.161 --> 06:55.291
<b><i>All residents of City J, please evacuate immediately.</i></b>

06:51.871 --> 06:53.121
<b>See what I mean?</b>

06:55.291 --> 06:55.751
<b>Hey!</b>

06:55.751 --> 06:57.251
<b><i>I repeat.</i></b>

06:57.251 --> 07:01.251
<b><i>All residents of City J, please evacuate immediately.</i></b>

07:01.881 --> 07:03.381
<b>Evacuate?</b>

07:03.381 --> 07:04.721
<b>How foolish.</b>

07:05.421 --> 07:08.011
<b>As if I'd allow even one of these apes to escape.</b>

07:11.811 --> 07:14.181
<b>So that's the one that got Stinger…</b>

07:14.981 --> 07:16.851
<b><i>But he's the last of 'em.</i></b>

07:16.851 --> 07:18.191
<b><i>Should I wait for backup?</i></b>

07:18.191 --> 07:21.651
<b><i>If it's one-on-one, maybe I can—</i></b>

07:30.031 --> 07:31.531
<b>That {smarts}{tingles}stung.</b>

07:31.531 --> 07:32.951
<b>Why would you do that?</b>

07:33.331 --> 07:35.751
<b><i>Dammit, how'd he get behind me?</i></b>

07:35.751 --> 07:37.461
<b><i>I was so surprised, my voice went all funky.</i></b>

07:38.251 --> 07:40.841
<b><i>Plus, my gunpowder-charged 
lightning kick had no effect!</i></b>

07:41.211 --> 07:42.881
<b><i>I can't win.</i></b>

07:42.881 --> 07:44.341
<b>Who are you?</b>

07:44.801 --> 07:46.171
<b>I am…</b>

07:46.171 --> 07:48.801
<b>Lightning Max, the hero.</b>

07:48.801 --> 07:49.721
<b>Fight me.</b>

07:49.721 --> 07:53.221
<b>Fight you? With pleasure.</b>

07:51.631 --> 07:53.221
<b><i>I'll run for it as soon as—</i></b>

07:57.891 --> 08:00.101
<b><i>What happened?</i></b>

08:00.521 --> 08:03.111
<b><i>I can't feel my body…</i></b>

08:09.821 --> 08:10.741
<b>Dammit.</b>

08:10.741 --> 08:13.241
<b>You arrogant bastard…{I really wanna use another word here but aaaaaaaaaaa}{would probably go for "son of a bitch" if I had the spine}{crap, I'm gonna end up overusing SOB just like bastard is often overused}</b>

08:14.081 --> 08:19.001
<b>Lightning Flying Reverse{Backwards} Roundhouse Kick!</b>

08:36.721 --> 08:38.681
<b>S-class hero,</b>

08:38.681 --> 08:40.231
<b>Puri-Puri Prisoner.</b>

08:41.191 --> 08:44.071
<b>I escaped from prison just to see you!</b>

08:44.071 --> 08:45.151
<b>Well, well.</b>

08:45.821 --> 08:48.951
<b>A hero serving time in prison?</b>

08:50.071 --> 08:53.701
<b>I knew I'd be able to escape if I followed you.{I tagged along and was able to escape too.}</b>

08:54.031 --> 08:55.031
<b>My thanks.</b>

08:55.031 --> 08:59.211
<b>Prisoner number 4188, Sonic, right?</b>

09:00.081 --> 09:01.581
<b>Surprised{ I know}?</b>

09:01.581 --> 09:03.831
<b>{You see, }I keep tabs on all the boys who catch my eye.</b>

09:04.461 --> 09:09.721
<b>I'm serving a life sentence because 
I can't resist attacking beautiful men.{what the hell is this guy's moral compass}</b>

09:10.221 --> 09:10.841
<b>Oh my.</b>

09:12.011 --> 09:15.761
<b>More soldiers have come for me?</b>

09:19.351 --> 09:20.561
<b>Goodness!</b>

09:20.561 --> 09:23.191
<b>I feel the power{strength} about to erupt out of him!{*}</b>

09:23.191 --> 09:24.731
<b>Sonic, dear, you hang back.</b>

09:26.021 --> 09:28.691
<b>Class A rank 11, sweet Stinger.</b>

09:28.691 --> 09:30.991
<b>Class A rank 20, Lightning Max.</b>

09:31.451 --> 09:34.241
<b>I fancied them both.</b>

09:34.661 --> 09:37.621
<b>And yet you ruined them!</b>

09:37.621 --> 09:40.831
<b>Now that Genos has passed me, 
I may be the lowest in rank,</b>

09:40.831 --> 09:42.921
<b>but I am still an S-class hero!</b>

09:42.921 --> 09:44.831
<b>I am unlike either of them.</b>

09:45.331 --> 09:49.591
<b>I'll begin at half power, 
to gauge how much you can take.</b>

09:58.101 --> 10:03.351
<b>You made me rip the hand-knit sweater my boyfriend made!</b>

10:03.351 --> 10:09.111
<b>I will never, ever forgive you!</b>

10:10.531 --> 10:13.361
<b>What a prime, delectable slab of meat.</b>

10:13.361 --> 10:15.361
<b>My appetite's up!</b>

10:23.291 --> 10:23.961
<b>Huh?</b>

10:24.501 --> 10:25.421
<b>Oh my…</b>

10:33.171 --> 10:34.631
<b>I felt that…</b>

10:35.261 --> 10:36.551
<b>just a little.</b>

10:37.091 --> 10:38.841
<b>I felt that too.</b>

10:38.841 --> 10:39.891
<b>Just a little.</b>

10:41.891 --> 10:46.151
<b><i>Puri-Puri Prisoner is acting tough, but he's hurting.</i></b>

10:46.151 --> 10:51.281
<b><i>So this is what a fight between a Demon-level monster and an S-class hero looks like?</i></b>

10:51.281 --> 10:52.531
<b><i>It's almost comical.</i></b>

10:53.781 --> 10:55.531
<b><i>Neither of them could defeat me.</i></b>

10:56.451 --> 10:57.621
<b><i>Dammit…</i></b>

10:57.621 --> 11:00.121
<b><i>His punch was stronger than I expected.</i></b>

11:00.121 --> 11:02.911
<b><i>But I must not lose to him.</i></b>

11:02.911 --> 11:07.171
<b><i>I can't have any more of my boys 
destroyed by this monster.</i></b>

11:07.171 --> 11:08.541
<b>I have no choice.</b>

11:08.921 --> 11:10.671
<b>I'll have to transform.</b>

